y>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Block force</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">110</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Block <a href=\"/wiki/Adrenaline\" title=\"Adrenaline\">Adrenaline</a></th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">2</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Passive</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"movement speed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movement speed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">-10%</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Wood tower shield</b> is the first tower <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons#Shields\" title=\"Weapons\">shield</a>. It has four more block armor and 80 more block force compared to <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wood shield\">Wood shield</a> but reduces movement speed by 10% as well as increasing dodge roll cost by 10%. \n</p><p>As a tower shield, it cannot be used to <a href=\"/wiki/Parry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Parry\">parry</a> enemy attacks. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_information\">Upgrade information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Tower_Shield%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Quality\n</th>\n<th>1\n</th>\n<th>2\n</th>\n<th>3\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Block armor\n</th>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Durability\n</th>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>250\n</td>\n<td>300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Crafting\n</th>\n<td>10 <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><br />6 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a>\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><br />3 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a>\n</td>\n<td>10 <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><br />6 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Workbench level\n</th>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Cost to max is 25 wood and 15 leather scraps.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Tower_Shield%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>When crafting, players can customize the shield with a few different pre-set designs and colors by clicking the style button beneath the item name in the crafting window. The design can not be changed afterward.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Images\">Images</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Tower_Shield%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 420px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/ca/WoodTowerShieldStyles.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210304195414\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The seven styles of the Wood tower shield\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/ca/WoodTowerShieldStyles.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210304195414\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"420\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"WoodTowerShieldStyles.jpg\" data-image-key=\"WoodTowerShieldStyles.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:WoodTowerShieldStyles.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The seven styles of the Wood tower shield</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:WeaponsNav\" title=\"Template:WeaponsNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:WeaponsNav\"><span title=\"Discuss this navbox template\">d</span></a> · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template:WeaponsNav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this navbox template\">e</span></a></span></span><div class=\"navbox-title-pad navbox-title-padleft navbox-title-padright\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapons</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\"><a href=\"/wiki/Axes\" title=\"Axes\">Axes</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">One-handed</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stone_Axe\" title=\"Stone Axe\">Stone Axe</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Flint_Axe\" title=\"Flint Axe\">Flint Axe</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_Axe\" title=\